  "description": "Productlane is a customer platform for engineering teams, built on Linear. It combines a support inbox, a help center, a changelog, and a feedback portal in one tool.\n\nThis connector exposes the Productlane API as MCP tools, so Claude works inside your workspace directly.\n\nClaude triages support threads and replies to customers. It files issues and projects that sync straight to Linear. Help center work runs through the same tools: draft an article, publish it, or move it into a new group. Claude also writes changelog entries and broadcasts them to subscribers. Contacts, companies, tags, and snippets round out the catalogue, alongside read access to your public roadmap and portal.\n\nAccess follows the scopes of your API key. Mint a read-only key for an agent that researches, or a scoped write key for one that acts. Rate limits and permissions match the REST API one to one.",
